+"""
+Package for managing warnings and interactive resolution.
+
+This package provides the entry point for the warning interception system,
+including stubs for interactive handling, decision resolution and rule
+evaluation.  It also exposes fully functional modules for database persistence,
+environment configuration and performance monitoring.  Future sprints should
+extend the stubs with real user interaction and rule application logic.
+"""
+

